# State the applied rules
At the end of every response, add a short **Rules applied** section that lists the rules that shaped the output.
- Name each rule by its file name (for example `project-overview.mdc`) and add a brief note on how it influenced the response.
- Include user rules and skills when they were used, labeled as such.
- List only rules that actually affected the output, not every rule that was loaded.
- If no rule beyond this one applied, say so.